    "text": "For the frequency distribution: Variate <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>15</mn></msub></math><br />Frequency <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>f</mi></mfenced><mo>:</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>15</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;<br />where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mn>15</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>15</mn></munderover><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> the standard deviation cannot be"
